  "prefLabel": "Site 102.03 Adaptive management",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Site 102.03 “Adaptive management” means a system of management practices based on specified desired outcomes, monitoring to determine if management actions are meeting the desired outcomes, and, if not, provisions for management changes designed to ensure that the desired outcomes are met or are re-evaluated.\n\nSource. #9182, eff 6-17-08; ss by #10993, eff 12-16-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/site100-300.html"
}
